# Shared password for the Learning Bridge+ (Cox's Bazar) / NRC section of the site.
# Set this in Vercel (Project Settings → Environment Variables) for Production and Preview, and
# locally in .env.local. If it is unset, that section is inaccessible in production (fail closed)
# and open in local development.
#
# It is a single shared secret handed to NRC and Amala colleagues — make it long, and change it
# by editing this variable and redeploying (which invalidates everyone's existing unlock).
LB_NRC_PASSWORD=
